DESCRIPTION:Let’s get messy this summer! Join us each week for a fun new
  experiment that explores the exciting\, reactive side of science. This we
 ek\, we’ll be creating groovy tie-dye artwork with in-built patterns mad
 e via the great outdoors. White cloth will be provided\, but as supplies a
 re limited\, we encourage you to bring your own cloth or clothes you want 
 to tie-dye!\n\n\nAprons will be available upon request for anyone looking 
 to mitigate the mess. No registration required\, as supplies last.\n\nAge
 s: 6-11\nRegistration: none\nSource: https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events
 /6a4c128a9302a0b2287ae2ed\nLast synced: 2026-07-23 08:10 PDT
