UID:smcl-6a5eabd30ed7b4521ed6a1a8@local-events
DESCRIPTION:The Library Green Team is a collaborative Earth-forward progra
 m that aims to build enthusiasm for caring for our planet and appreciating
  nature. Participants will engage in exciting\, eco-friendly\, nature-rela
 ted crafts\, games\, and activities while learning more about their role a
 s upcoming planet protectors. \n\nJoin us in the Children’s Garden and M
 akerspace to make your very own beaded wormie! Complete some “feed the w
 ormies” sorting challenges to get your official Super-Sorter Green Team 
 badge.\n\nAges: 6-11\nRegistration: none\nSource: https://smcl.bibliocommo
 ns.com/events/6a5eabd30ed7b4521ed6a1a8\nLast synced: 2026-07-23 08:10 PDT
