BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[ATH] Jurassic Jabber Paleontology
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260730T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260730T170000
DTSTAMP:20260723T151012Z
UID:smcl-69fb6edb703c33630025d57e@local-events
DESCRIPTION:There is so much to learn about dinosaurs! Join dino expert Be
 n Manarello as he discusses 240 million years of information about these c
 aptivating creatures. We will learn about the dinosaurs' ways of life\, di
 fferent kinds of fossils\, and the science and technology behind uncoverin
 g our prehistoric past. Touch life-size replicas of huge T. rex skulls and
  interact with hands-on tools and artifacts. Plus\, kids can take home the
 ir own authentic fossil! Jurassic Jabber is scientific fun for the whole f
 amily\, and all ages are welcome.\n\nAges: 6-11\nRegistration: none\nSourc
 e: https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/69fb6edb703c33630025d57e\nLast sy
 nced: 2026-07-23 08:10 PDT
LOCATION:Atherton Library\, 2 Dinkelspiel Station Ln\, Atherton\, CA 94027
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/69fb6edb703c33630025d57e
END:VEVENT
