DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260808T130000
DTSTAMP:20260723T151012Z
UID:sancarlos-1095@local-events
DESCRIPTION:The City\, in partnership with RethinkWaste and Recology San M
 ateo County will host a free document shredding event for San Carlos resid
 ents on August 8\, 2026 from 9:00 a.m. to 1:00 p.m. at the San Carlos Corp
 oration Yard. Residents may bring up to a maximum of three standard size b
 ankers boxes (10&rdquo\; x 12&rdquo\; x 15&rdquo\;) per household. The shr
 ed event will last until 1:00 p.m. or until the truck is full &ndash\; whi
 chever comes first. Date: August 8\, 2026 Time: 9:00 a.m. &ndash\; 1:00 p.
 m. Location: San Carlos Corporation Yard\, 1000 Bransten Road\, San Carlos
 \n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://www.cityofsancarlos.org/calendar.php\n
 Last synced: 2026-07-23 08:10 PDT
LOCATION:1000 Bransten Road\, San Carlos\, CA 94070
URL:https://www.cityofsancarlos.org/calendar.php
END:VEVENT
