BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[WS] Summer Nights
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260723T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260723T200000
DTSTAMP:20260723T151012Z
UID:filoli-22099@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Chase the sunset at Filoli.\n\n\nSummer Nights brings a softer
 \, more laid-back vibe than Summer Stage. Think of it as the more chill li
 ttle brother.\n\nHeld every Wednesday and Thursday\, it is all about golde
 n-hour garden strolls\, drinks\, bites\, and live acoustic music in a rela
 xed midweek atmosphere.\n\nTickets: Adults $45\, Children 5–17 $35\n\nMe
 mbers receive 20% off\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://filoli.org/event/
 summer-nights-5/2026-07-23/\nLast synced: 2026-07-23 08:10 PDT
LOCATION:Filoli Historic House & Garden\, 86 Cañada Road\, Woodside
URL:https://filoli.org/event/summer-nights-5/2026-07-23/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[WS] Sunset Hikes
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260723T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260723T193000
DTSTAMP:20260723T151012Z
UID:filoli-22075@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Wander through Filoli’s Natural Lands in search of mushrooms
 \, fungi\, lichen\, and mosses. Guided by experts\, you’ll explore both 
 familiar trails and quieter corners where these treasures await.\n\nExperi
 ence Includes:\n\n90-minute guided tour through Filoli’s Natural Lands\,
  led by expert Filoli staff\nExclusive access to trails typically closed t
 o the public\nGeneral admission to Filoli\n\nCost: $75\; includes General 
 Admission\n\nMembers receive 5% off\n\nPlease note: Hikes traverse uneven 
 terrain\, including steps and trails\, that are considered moderate diffic
 ulty.\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://filoli.org/event/sunset-hikes-3/2
 026-07-23/\nLast synced: 2026-07-23 08:10 PDT
LOCATION:Filoli Historic House & Garden\, 86 Cañada Road\, Woodside
URL:https://filoli.org/event/sunset-hikes-3/2026-07-23/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[WS] Art Walk
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260725T190000
DTSTAMP:20260723T151012Z
UID:filoli-22061@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Creativity around every corner.\n\nFiloli’s Art Walk is back
  this year\, with a twist! New at Art Walk is the children’s art area 
 where young creators can dive into hands-on activities that spark their im
 agination!\n\nStroll through Filoli’s stunning Garden while local makers
  showcase handmade treasures to gift or keep for yourself! Enjoy local foo
 d trucks and discover creativity around every corner—whether you’re an
  art lover or simply searching for something special.\n\nTickets: Free\, G
 eneral Admission is required to attend.\n\nMembers receive free admission\
 , reservation required.\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://filoli.org/even
 t/art-walk/2026-07-25/\nLast synced: 2026-07-23 08:10 PDT
LOCATION:Filoli Historic House & Garden\, 86 Cañada Road\, Woodside
URL:https://filoli.org/event/art-walk/2026-07-25/
END:VEVENT
